      "raw_response": "Thought: I will write a Python script to solve the 12x12 N-Queens problem with the four pre-placed queens at (1, 2), (5, 11), (7, 7), and (9, 8).\nAction: execute_python\nAction Input: {\"code\": \"def solve_n_queens(n, fixed_queens):\\n    board = [-1] * n\\n    for r, c in fixed_queens:\\n        board[r] = c\\n\\n    def is_safe(row, col):\\n        for r in range(n):\\n            if board[r] != -1:\\n                if board[r] == col or abs(board[r] - col) == abs(r - row):\\n                    return False\\n        return True\\n\\n    def solve(row):\\n        if row == n:\\n            return True\\n        if board[row] != -1:\\n            return solve(row + 1)\\n        for col in range(n):\\n            if is_safe(row, col):\\n                board[row] = col\\n                if solve(row + 1):\\n                    return True\\n                board[row] = -1\\n        return False\\n\\n    if solve(0):\\n        return board\\n    return None\\n\\nfixed = [(1, 2), (5, 11), (7, 7), (9, 8)]\\nsolution = solve_n_queens(12, fixed)\\nif solution:\\n    for r in range(12):\\n        row_str = ['_'] * 12\\n        row_str[solution[r]] = 'Q'\\n        print(' '.join(row_str))\\n\"}\n",
